<title>GUYANA: CRICKET-INDIA V GUYANA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA V GUYANA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>GEORGETOWN, Guyana 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the third day of the four-day tour match between India and Guyana at Bourda on Sunday.</p>
<p>India first innings 341 (A.Jadeja 106, R.King 7-82)</p>
<p>Guyana first innings (overnight 214 for 6) S.Chanderpaul not out		  176</p>
<p>V.Nagamootoo c Kuruvilla b Joshi    21</p>
<p>M.Nagamootoo b Joshi		     7</p>
<p>R.King c Ganguly b Joshi		 1</p>
<p>C.Stuart c Kuruvilla b David	   0</p>
<p>Extras (lb12, w2, nb10)		 24</p>
<p>Total (all out)			  300</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-33 2-44 3-57 4-57 5-95 6-131 7-224 8-240 9-256</p>
<p>Bowling: Kuruvilla 14-1-49-1 (6nb), Ganesh 25-5-74-3 (1w), David 20-1-59-1 (3nb, 1w), Joshi 33-8-98-5 (1nb), Singh 3-1-8-0, Jadeja 1-1-0-0.</p>
